  "cards": [
    {"dot":"cyan","title":"Transport & trust boundary","items":["Server exposes Streamable HTTP only and runs stateless HTTP; host/origin allowlists are configured at startup.","The server has no model or agent dependency; the optional reference host is a separate process."]},
    {"dot":"emerald","title":"Read-only data path","items":["Packaged fixture is validated and indexed in memory; tools filter and aggregate it without an external database.","Seven handlers return typed structured results. Successful normalized results may be cached locally for 300 seconds."]},
